WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.870
- [Joe] I think, like everybody,
I'm interested in stories

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.199
about ghosts or extraterrestrials.

00:00:07.199 --> 00:00:08.688
Some people would say,
"Well don't explain that,

00:00:08.688 --> 00:00:09.521
"don't explain that.

00:00:09.521 --> 00:00:10.771
"I wanna believe that."

00:00:10.771 --> 00:00:12.839
People call me a debunker.

00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:15.279
They say I'm trying to disprove;

00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:17.548
I'm raining on their parade,

00:00:17.548 --> 00:00:18.381
and you know what?

00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:22.548
I don't apologize at all for
trying to find the truth.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.334
- [News Reporter] And Joe
Nickell from the Committee

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.070
for Skeptical Inquiry.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.002
- [Announcer] We've invited
renowned skeptic, Joe Nickell,

00:00:32.002 --> 00:00:33.532
to meet Cora Lorenzo.

00:00:33.532 --> 00:00:37.395
- This medieval
superstition has got to go.

00:00:37.395 --> 00:00:40.468
And this is really just, just silly.

00:00:40.468 --> 00:00:44.364
I'm Joe Nickell, and I'm a
paranormal investigator.

00:00:44.364 --> 00:00:48.310
I investigate everything
from monsters, ghosts,

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.977
aliens, psychics, for
a science organization

00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:56.145
and the magazine, Skeptical Inquirer.

00:00:56.145 --> 00:00:59.801
I knew at the age of eight
that I was a detective,

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:03.190
but I eventually became a stage magician.

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.793
Oh my goodness!

00:01:04.793 --> 00:01:08.817
My models were Harry
Houdini and other magicians

00:01:08.817 --> 00:01:13.003
who used their magic
talents to expose trickery.

00:01:13.003 --> 00:01:15.327
And meanwhile, like
everybody, I was curious

00:01:15.327 --> 00:01:18.683
about haunted houses and flying saucers,

00:01:18.683 --> 00:01:22.420
and I decided I wanted to
do something like that.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.587
I've written about 40 books,
primarily on mysteries.

00:01:28.159 --> 00:01:31.105
A lot of cases were miracle claims

00:01:31.105 --> 00:01:33.819
or some kind of religious claims.

00:01:33.819 --> 00:01:37.406
Spontaneous human combustion,
lake monster mysteries,

00:01:37.406 --> 00:01:40.107
crop circles, UFO sightings, chupacabras,

00:01:40.107 --> 00:01:41.563
ghosts, Bigfoot.

00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:43.993
(paper shuffling)

00:01:43.993 --> 00:01:47.410
What I'm trying to do
is actually investigate,

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:49.698
looking for facts and clues.

00:01:49.698 --> 00:01:52.699
As you begin to put together a case file,

00:01:52.699 --> 00:01:56.727
you fill the file folder
with what data you have,

00:01:56.727 --> 00:02:00.328
and then trying to find
actually corroborative evidence,

00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:03.339
so that I can try to
explain what's happening,

00:02:03.339 --> 00:02:05.952
explain a UFO sighting.

00:02:05.952 --> 00:02:09.285
My explanations are often quite mundane.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.951
People report seeing these long-necked,

00:02:12.951 --> 00:02:15.060
multi-humped lake monsters.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.084
There are many things that
can create the illusion

00:02:17.084 --> 00:02:20.601
of a lake monster, including
two, or three, or four otters

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:22.144
swimming in line,

00:02:22.144 --> 00:02:25.096
which create the effect
of one large creature.

00:02:25.096 --> 00:02:28.679
Bigfoot is a tall,
hairy, bipedal creature.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:34.307
There is a creature that
looks very much like Bigfoot.

00:02:34.307 --> 00:02:37.636
That is a black bear or a brown bear,

00:02:37.636 --> 00:02:41.094
standing, sniffing the
air and walking about.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:44.613
People driving by an old
mansion in the little community

00:02:44.613 --> 00:02:48.327
of Burt, New York sometimes
reported seeing a ghostly figure

00:02:48.327 --> 00:02:49.798
dressed in white.

00:02:49.798 --> 00:02:52.479
As it turns out, they'd had
a mannequin dressed in white

00:02:52.479 --> 00:02:54.963
in the window and that was responsible

00:02:54.963 --> 00:02:57.493
for many of those sightings.

00:02:57.493 --> 00:03:01.069
I think part of me would
like for there to be ghosts,

00:03:01.069 --> 00:03:03.657
and for there to be extraterrestrials,

00:03:03.657 --> 00:03:08.233
but I've done this a long
time and I'm pretty sure

00:03:08.233 --> 00:03:10.444
that ghosts don't exist.

00:03:10.444 --> 00:03:13.480
Even the skeptics who
like what I do will often,

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:17.113
their first reaction is
hmm, that's pretty obvious.

00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:21.171
Everything is obvious
after it's been explained.

00:03:21.171 --> 00:03:24.254
(fun chiming music)

